Use standard browser modules and Node's built-in test runner, with no build step or external runtime dependencies. Provide a polished responsive English interface with warm off-white, ink text, muted teal and accessible form controls. Domain logic should be separate from rendering and local storage should handle invalid records and failures gracefully.

Every feature must include meaningful behavior tests, actual verification results, and a concise feature review note in evidence/. Preserve status In Progress and approval pending. Do not claim unperformed browser tests. Keep product copy and project documentation free of authorship attribution. Do not edit conversation records or remove their original content.
